  "routineTemplateBrushTeethText": "Brushing teeth",
  "routineTemplateBrushTeethPrompt": "I want my Elumi to brush their teeth alone. Walk through taking out the toothbrush and toothpaste, filling the cup with water, brushing, rinsing and putting things away",
  "routineTemplateWashFaceText": "Washing face",
  "routineTemplateWashFacePrompt": "I want my Elumi to wash their face alone in the morning. Walk through turning on the water, wetting the face, making soap bubbles, rinsing, drying with a towel and putting on lotion",
  "routineTemplateGetDressedText": "Getting dressed alone",
  "routineTemplateGetDressedPrompt": "I want my Elumi to get dressed alone. Walk through putting on an undershirt, a T-shirt, pants and socks one at a time",
  "routineTemplateEatMealText": "Mealtime",
  "routineTemplateEatMealPrompt": "I want my Elumi to handle mealtime on their own. Walk through drinking water, bringing their own spoon and bowl, sitting down to eat and taking the dishes back",
  "routineTemplateBathTimeText": "Bath time",
  "routineTemplateBathTimePrompt": "I want my Elumi to take a bath step by step. Walk through taking off clothes, wetting the body, washing hair, washing the body, rinsing, drying with a towel and getting dressed",
  "routineTemplateMorningRoutineText": "Getting ready for school",
  "routineTemplateMorningRoutinePrompt": "I want my Elumi to do everything from waking up to leaving for school in order. Walk through getting up, using the bathroom, eating, washing and brushing, getting dressed, and putting on the backpack and shoes",
  "routineTemplateAfterSchoolText": "After school",
  "routineTemplateAfterSchoolPrompt": "I want my Elumi to do things on their own after coming home from school. Walk through putting away shoes, washing hands, putting the bag in its place, having a snack and taking a break",
  "routineTemplateBedtimeText": "Getting ready for bed",
  "routineTemplateBedtimePrompt": "I want my Elumi to do the bedtime steps in order. Walk through brushing teeth, putting on pajamas, packing tomorrow's bag, and turning off the light to lie down",
  "routineTemplateGoingOutText": "Getting ready to go out",
  "routineTemplateGoingOutPrompt": "I want my Elumi to get ready to go out on their own. Walk through using the bathroom, putting on a jacket, taking a water bottle and phone, putting on shoes and waiting by the door",
  "routineTemplateTidyRoomText": "Tidying the room",
  "routineTemplateTidyRoomPrompt": "I want my Elumi to tidy their room after playing. Walk through gathering toys, putting them in the box, shelving books and hanging clothes",
  "routineTemplateClearDishesText": "Clearing dishes",
  "routineTemplateClearDishesPrompt": "I want my Elumi to clear their dishes after eating. Walk through gathering leftovers, carrying the dishes, putting them in the sink and wiping the table",
  "routineTemplateFoldLaundryText": "Folding laundry",
  "routineTemplateFoldLaundryPrompt": "I want my Elumi to fold and put away dry laundry. Walk through bringing the laundry, matching socks, folding towels, folding clothes and putting them in the drawer",
  "routineTemplateTakeOutTrashText": "Taking out the trash",
  "routineTemplateTakeOutTrashPrompt": "I want my Elumi to sort and take out the trash. Walk through gathering trash, separating paper and plastic, tying the bag and taking it to the right place",
  "routineTemplateRideBusText": "Riding the bus",
  "routineTemplateRideBusPrompt": "I want my Elumi to practice riding the bus alone. Walk through checking the bus number at the stop, lining up, tapping the transit card, sitting down and pressing the bell at their stop",
  "routineTemplateBuyItemText": "Buying something at a store",
  "routineTemplateBuyItemPrompt": "I want my Elumi to buy something at a convenience store alone. Walk through finding the item, lining up at the counter, putting the item down, paying by card or cash, and taking the receipt and saying thanks",
  "routineTemplateUseElevatorText": "Taking the elevator to a floor",
  "routineTemplateUseElevatorPrompt": "I want my Elumi to take the elevator to a set floor alone. Walk through pressing the button, getting on when the door opens, pressing the floor number, watching the floor display and getting off",
  "routineTemplateHospitalVisitText": "Going to the doctor",
  "routineTemplateHospitalVisitPrompt": "I want my Elumi to go through a doctor visit in order. Walk through checking in, waiting in the waiting room, going in when called, seeing the doctor, and getting medicine and saying goodbye",
  "routineTemplateStartHomeworkText": "Starting homework",
  "routineTemplateStartHomeworkPrompt": "I want my Elumi to start and finish homework on their own. Walk through sitting at the desk, taking out the notebook and pencil, doing the homework, showing it when done and putting it in the bag",
  "routineTemplateWriteNameText": "Practicing writing a name",
  "routineTemplateWriteNamePrompt": "I want my Elumi to hold a pencil properly and write their name. Walk through holding the pencil, placing the paper, tracing the name, writing it alone and cleaning up",
  "routineTemplateCountObjectsText": "Counting game",
  "routineTemplateCountObjectsPrompt": "I want my Elumi to practice counting objects one by one. Walk through laying out the objects, pointing to each with a finger, counting out loud and saying the total",
  "routineTemplateReadBookText": "Reading time",
  "routineTemplateReadBookPrompt": "I want my Elumi to have reading time on their own. Walk through choosing a book, sitting down, turning the pages one by one and putting the book back on the shelf",
  "routineTemplateEmotionCardText": "Showing a feelings card when upset",
  "routineTemplateEmotionCardPrompt": "When my Elumi gets angry at a friend, I want them to show a feelings card instead of yelling or pushing. Walk through stopping, taking the feelings card out of the pocket, choosing the card for how they feel and showing it to the teacher",
  "routineTemplatePlayNicelyText": "Playing nicely with friends",
  "routineTemplatePlayNicelyPrompt": "I want my Elumi to practice playing nicely with friends. Walk through asking to play together, sharing toys, taking turns and saying thank you at the end",
  "routineTemplateGreetingText": "Saying hello",
  "routineTemplateGreetingPrompt": "I want my Elumi to greet people first. Walk through looking at the person's face, waving, saying hello and smiling",
  "routineTemplateWaitTurnText": "Waiting your turn",
  "routineTemplateWaitTurnPrompt": "I want my Elumi to practice waiting in line for their turn. Walk through standing at the end of the line, waiting behind the person in front, checking when it's their turn and going when it comes",
  "routineTemplateAskHelpText": "Asking for help",
  "routineTemplateAskHelpPrompt": "I want my Elumi to ask for help when something is hard. Walk through stopping, finding a nearby adult, saying 'please help me', and saying thank you after getting help",
